# Event Taxonomy Tracker - Root Environment Configuration
# This file is for convenience - the actual .env should be in apps/api/

# See apps/api/.env.example for detailed configuration options

# Quick Start:
# 1. Copy apps/api/.env.example to apps/api/.env
# 2. Add your ANTHROPIC_API_KEY to apps/api/.env
# 3. Run: bun run dev

# Alternatively, create apps/api/.env with:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...
